    "Content": "<p>Stream Analytics now allows users to attach query columns as user properties to outgoing messages. This helps facilitate downstream processing, reporting etc. You can learn more <a href=\"https://docs.microsoft.com/azure/stream-analytics/stream-analytics-define-outputs#custom-metadata-properties-for-output\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">here</a>.&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n",
